    "identityStatus": "{\"relationship\": {\"country\": \"Australia\", \"evidence\": [\"evidence/cocos-relationship.body\", \"evidence/cocos-relationship-text.txt\", \"evidence/cocos-nasa-article.body\", \"evidence/cocos-nasa-article-text.txt\", \"evidence/cocos-item.body\"], \"explanation\": \"The native SSI/Scubago site profile 278793 explicitly names “Cabbage Patch Cocos Keeling” and calls it a dive site in the Cocos Islands, credited to COCOS DIVE, COCOS K ISLANDS. The eligible inventory uses the same native site identity and coordinates on the western South Keeling atoll reef. The independently retained NASA South Keeling article explicitly links photo ISS070-E-74721 to the photographed South Keeling atoll and distinguishes it from North Keeling outside the frame. This supports broad atoll environmental context, not an exact underwater coral-garden depiction.\", \"inventory_coordinates\": [-12.0946, 96.8422], \"limitations\": \"Historical atoll environmental context only. Exact Cabbage Patch coral structures, dive-site boundaries and the inventory point are not certified as depicted. Native item has no photo-center coordinates, and no precise footprint was verified. No dive-navigation or current-conditions use. The distinct official tourism publisher returned robots403 and was not retried; the independent native SSI/Scubago profile was discovered directly and is not a proxy or copy of that tourism page. Inventory photo need is retained, not live-checked.\", \"native_relationship_url\": \"https://www.scubago.com/en/explore/divesite/cabbage-patch-cocos-keeling-278793\", \"region\": \"\", \"scope\": \"EXPLICIT_NAMED_ISLAND_COASTAL_SETTING_ONLY\", \"target_name\": \"Cabbage Patch Cocos Keeling\", \"target_site_id\": \"09508b76-2db9-4a96-9e1a-f20686cecd8a\", \"target_slug\": \"cabbage-patch-cocos-keeling\"}}",
